{"id":"u-2721becf-34ec-4c4b-920e-fcf547dbe7ec","src":"community","title":"RPT Blood And Guts 2.0","author":"Dusty D.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/2blcgQ-rpt-blood-and-guts-20","desc":"Swapped some exercises from the original I found on Boostcamp. Credit goes to the original creator. Thumbnail image is of Agostino Russo. Low volume, high intensity Arnold split.\n\n\"To get more jacked and stacked then ever before. \nFocus on using high intensity reverse pyramid training. Low volume for max recovery. Push hard and progress every week.\n\nEach set to be progressed individually, 6-8 range is its own progression compared to 8-10  / 10-12 range. Once at the top of rep range, increase weight and aim for low end of range. Aim for 1 rep increase per week. Rep in reserve for each set should be 0-1.\n\nBe sure to warm up, first set is all out.\nRest for 3 min between sets.\n\nExample: \nWeek One: 135 x 7, 120 x 9, 110 x 11\nWeek Two: 135 x 8, 120 x 10, 110 x 12\nWeek Three: 140 x 6, 125 x 8, 115 x 10\n\nSample Split - Monday, Wednesday, Friday. At least one day off between lifting days. Low impact cardio or lots of walking can be done on off days.\"","level":["Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Muscle","Women's"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":50,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-15T02:16:25.054Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Chest and Back","Legs +Abs","Shoulders + Arms"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8},{"lo":8,"hi":10},{"lo":10,"hi":12}]},{"n":"Chin-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8},{"lo":8,"hi":10},{"lo":10,"hi":12}]},{"n":"Dip (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8},{"lo":8,"hi":10},{"lo":10,"hi":12}]},{"n":"Pendlay Row","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8},{"lo":8,"hi":10},{"lo":10,"hi":12}]},{"n":"Pec Deck (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Reverse Pec Deck","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":10,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Leg Extension (With Yoga Block)","sets":[{"lo":15,"h